  "body": "## Summary\n- Records a fresh 2026-09-10 Nubia P0110/pacific no-Host Android UI/UX current-main evidence package after PR #731.\n- Retains device identity, read-only adb reverse/lsof boundary checks, focused instrumentation and JVM logs/results, checksum manifest, and a manual first-screen screenshot.\n- Documents that no Mac Host/GUI, TCC, Host-backed E2E, or adb reverse mapping creation was used or claimed.\n\n## Verification\n- Device identity: adb reported online serial <redacted-adb-serial> as nubia P0110 / pacific / Android 16 / API 36; retained files redact the serial.\n- No-Host boundary: read-only `adb reverse --list` was empty before/after; `lsof -nP -iTCP:54321 -sTCP:LISTEN` returned status 1 before/after.\n- `./gradlew --no-daemon :app:testDebugUnitTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityClipboardSystemBoundaryContractTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityFileTransferSystemBoundaryContractTest --tests dev.telemachus.display.MainActivityTransferReadinessContractTest` passed 19/19.\n- `ANDROID_SERIAL=<redacted> ./gradlew --no-daemon :app:connectedDebugAndroidTest -Pandroid.testInstrumentationRunnerArguments.class=...` passed 87/87 on P0110 - 16.\n- Manual no-Host screenshot: `screenshots/nohost-main.png` shows the USB retry surface without obvious clipping/overlap.\n- `shasum -a 256 -c SHA256SUMS` passed for all retained artifacts.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added a comprehensive Android 16 UI/UX audit record for a Nubia P0110 device.\n  * Included reproducibility details, device metadata, screenshots, logs, test results, limitations, and checksum verification guidance.\n  * Added browsable HTML reports covering instrumentation and JVM contract results.\n\n* **Tests**\n  * Documented 87/87 successful instrumentation tests and 19/19 successful focused contract tests, with no failures or skipped tests.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
